        "\\section{\\mbox{Structure-Controllable Text Generation}}\n",
        "\\label{section:gen}\n",
        "\\subsection{Task Definition}\n",
        "As aforementioned, in uncontrolled generation, users cannot instruct the model to emphasize on desired aspects.\n",
