            "We provide baselines of uncontrolled generation and controlled generation on MReD using other common Transformer pretrained models in Table \\ref{tab:pretrained_models}. Note that due to limited GPU space, we cannot fit 2048 input tokens for T5. Thus, for fair comparison, all results shown are from source truncation of 1024.\n",
