            "\\subsection{Human evaluation}\n",
            "\\label{append:human_eval}\n",
            "For structure similarity, we instruct the judges to label each generated sentence with the closest category.\n",
            "We then calculate the normalized token-level edit distance between the judge-annotated label sequence and the given control sequence, where each label is considered as a single token, and finally deduct this value from 1.\n",
            "\n",
            "\n",
            "For decision correctness, we evaluate it on a binary scale where 1 indicates complete correctness and 0 otherwise.\n",
            "More specifically, we give 0 if the generation produces either contradictory decisions or a wrong decision, or if the generation does not show enough hints for rejection or acceptance. \n",
